y learn why a tool must be job-related, consistent, useful, and monitored for unequal impact.", "children": [{"id": "84de757b-02d0-4980-9455-859dbc39c141", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Reliability and validity", "children": [{"id": "23c942ba-b6e8-466c-bdeb-20984cb54222", "type": "concept", "title": "Inter-rater reliability"}, {"id": "ad63b405-15e8-410c-9ee2-d56d092ae5af", "type": "concept", "title": "Test-retest reliability"}, {"id": "44a2ccb4-64af-45cd-9826-dce3ce57de9a", "type": "concept", "title": "Content validity"}, {"id": "3edcb127-6747-49b2-a944-9d194c62b622", "type": "concept", "title": "Criterion validity"}, {"id": "5551ab56-686b-4931-a2de-4f78d72f36e9", "type": "concept", "title": "Construct validity"}, {"id": "2b66e64d-cba1-4e58-bf36-624575f08e84", "type": "concept", "title": "Validation evidence"}], "description": "Students learn the core concepts that separate defensible assessment from guesswork."}, {"id": "bb66bb64-66ca-4e89-bad9-aec21e0810f0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Selection utility", "children": [{"id": "3e616e1e-7053-4155-af6d-89c490c72246", "type": "concept", "title": "Base rates"}, {"id": "27f63f65-e65f-4da3-bf32-66b6949c746c", "type": "concept", "title": "Selection ratios"}, {"id": "cf60119a-f52b-40a8-967b-0185fd230aa6", "type": "concept", "title": "Predictive value"}, {"id": "cedcdcba-b234-4c99-b2e2-062a842c6351", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost of errors"}, {"id": "8ea207ed-eb5e-45a2-8471-c69c0bc9df94", "type": "concept", "title": "False positives"}, {"id": "43a283d1-8720-4a7c-9c72-bb667e785b29", "type": "concept", "title": "False negatives"}], "description": "This subtopic connects assessment quality to business outcomes and hiring tradeoffs."}, {"id": "06e54838-f4a9-498e-ab55-598e04c25634", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Adverse impact analysis", "children": [{"id": "f9ff4aba-a02a-4cb8-ac1a-064e53219de0", "type": "concept", "title": "Four-fifths rule"}, {"id": "2242e98b-221d-42c5-85e9-cc58449880d2", "type": "concept", "title": "Applicant-flow data"}, {"id": "a7033d0f-bb86-4c67-95e6-21b843c7462d", "type": "concept", "title": "Statistical significance basics"}, {"id": "72afb7d2-fa31-4cb6-8b23-32365b62b64a", "type": "concept", "title": "Alternative procedures"}, {"id": "5ed53546-6169-4a97-b6b6-03ad0d3264bc", "type": "concept", "title": "Business necessity"}, {"id": "4b9201a7-b3cb-4db0-a8a0-b40ba5b4086c", "type": "concept", "title": "Remediation planning"}], "description": "Students learn to identify and respond to selection patterns that disproportionately screen out protected groups."}]}, {"id": "8e2ada87-017d-4149-8a99-a71eebe37e20", "type": "topic", "title": "Candidate Experience, Offers, and Hiring Handoff", "description": "Recruitment is also an experience design problem. Students learn how communication, speed, transparency, negotiation, and onboarding handoff influence acceptance, trust, and employer reputation.", "children": [{"id": "eb6561d8-8be1-43e5-a062-8fac21ba6bf2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Candidate communication", "children": [{"id": "3de8e512-bfe3-4916-9089-715d8882c736", "type": "concept", "title": "Status updates"}, {"id": "8ad331fe-d449-48a1-a208-63af65e28faf", "type": "concept", "title": "Timelines"}, {"id": "0b54899d-9fe5-4a3a-aac6-4fa34f70bcd2", "type": "concept", "title": "Rejection messages"}, {"id": "48871091-926c-455c-b42b-6d4aa5e58d91", "type": "concept", "title": "Feedback boundaries"}, {"id": "06274b48-e8f5-4f1d-ab94-535153747a39", "type": "concept", "title": "Accessibility"}, {"id": "f4febaff-75f9-4630-b9b5-da06e385484c", "type": "concept", "title": "Candidate FAQs"}], "description": "Students learn to keep candidates informed without sacrificing process integrity."}, {"id": "62a29af0-e998-4505-97d2-863062ec281a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Offer strategy and negotiation", "children": [{"id": "66791bc9-765e-4628-b72e-ceb47cd2e6c1", "type": "concept", "title": "Offer approval"}, {"id": "34a2bb4d-b1b5-470f-bd35-1a2bd21957af", "type": "concept", "title": "Pay 